Scalar
======

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android and Scalar, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

### Initialize repository

To initialize your local repository using the Scalar trees, use:

```bash
repo init -u https://github.com/projectscalar/manifest.git -b 16 --git-lfs
```

### Sync source tree

To sync the source code:

```bash
repo sync -c --no-clone-bundle --optimized-fetch --prune --force-sync -j$(nproc --all)
```

Building
--------

Set up your build environment:

```bash
source build/envsetup.sh
lunch lineage_<device>-bp4a-userdebug
mka bacon
```

Contributing
------------

Patches and contributions are welcome! Feel free to open Pull Requests or submit issues directly on our [GitHub Organization](https://github.com/projectscalar).

